The third planted build, for the second half of the browser arm, with the page script's plant chosen by DASH_HOME_PLANT=no-post:
  no-post: the dismiss folds the notice and posts nothing; no-hold: a state that arrives while the notice folds is drawn at once.
Everything else is the code. TestDefaults' InProcessHang is 1 min and BrowserHang 2 min in this build only, so a planted wait ends sooner.
